<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Televisa.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Televisa.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kleinwort Benson analyst Justin McGowan said he initiated coverage of Grupo Televisa SA de CV with a long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect to see 1997 earnings rise 137 percent thanks to the one-off effects of asset disposal, but, more importantly, underlying year-on-year operating earnings growth is 21 percent in 1996 and 32 percent in 1997,&quot; McGowan said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 30-1/8.</p>
</text>
